I regret that I won't be at the Dedham conference.

I was wondering about the 6th European TeX conference in Paris in
September.  From the "announcement of the preliminary programme", I see
that several LaTeX-L people will be there as speakers.  If Rainer/Frank
were there too, it looks as though there could be a LaTeX3 meeting =
there.
In fact, "whether or not there is a LaTeX3 meeting" might be what tips =
the
balance in favour of my "going or not going" to the Paris conference.

David Rhead
(JANET: d.rhead@uk.ac.nottingham.ccc.vme)



